    "highlights": [
      {
        "text": "Among equity categories, small cap funds drew the largest net inflow in September, ₹9,038.57 crore, followed by mid cap (₹7,834.84 crore) and flexi cap (₹6,701.80 crore) funds. ELSS (tax-saving) funds saw a net outflow of ₹662 crore.",
