          "name": "Outlook Money",
          "url": "https://www.outlookmoney.com/invest/amfi-data-september-2026-equity-mf-inflows-38307-crore-rupees"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "Liquid funds saw a net outflow of ₹95,743 crore and money market funds ₹50,846 crore, while gold ETFs took in ₹4,451 crore and silver ETFs ₹1,974 crore.",
        "source": {
          "name": "Angel One",
          "url": "https://www.angelone.in/news/mutual-funds/amfi-data-mutual-fund-mobilisation-climbs-to-15-25-lakh-crore-in-september-2026-debt-funds-see-1-83-lakh-crore-net-outflow"
